WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.373
A mant di government modules tour.

2
00:00:02.373 --> 00:00:13.737
SaloneHCM di Gov tier de ad di controls we public payroll de demand: civil service salary structure, establishment discipline, budget checks bifo moni de muv, ɛn public transparency.

3
00:00:13.737 --> 00:00:14.986
Mek wi tour ɛch wan.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:22.309
Di civil service module de hold yu grade ɛn step salary matrix, allowance rules, ɛn budget codes.

5
00:00:22.309 --> 00:00:32.490
Salaries de flow frɔm di structure — nɔto frɔm ad-hoc nɔmbas — so grade seven step three officer na Bo de earn ɛgzaktli wetin di structure se, sem lɛk na Freetown.

6
00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.426
Retro-pay ɛn ghost-worker audit tools de ya to.

7
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.821
Establishment control de compare approved posts agenst filled posts, ministry bay ministry.

8
00:00:41.821 --> 00:00:48.922
Over-establishment hiring de get flag bifo i bigin payroll liability, ɛn vacancies de visible fɔ workforce planning.

9
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:20.666
Bifo ɛni payroll run commit, di budget check de verify se allocation dɔn lɛf pan ɛvri budget code we di run go consume.

10
00:01:20.666 --> 00:01:26.274
If wan code dɔn ova, di run de block — ɛn ɔnli documented override wit reason kin proceed.

11
00:01:26.274 --> 00:01:31.322
Pan di payroll page, di budget balances panel de sho ɛgzaktli usai ɛch code stan.

12
00:01:53.250 --> 00:02:04.798
Faynali, di open-gov transparency portal — wan public page, no login required — de publish aggregate payroll statistics fɔ yu ministry: headcount, wage bill trends, ɛn grade distributions.

13
00:02:04.798 --> 00:02:09.282
Citizens ɛn journalists de si di nɔmbas; personal data de stay protected.

14
00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:16.462
Structure, establishment, budget discipline, ɛn daylight — di fɔ pillars fɔ clean government payroll.

15
00:02:16.462 --> 00:02:21.506
Tek di government modules quiz na di Training Center fɔ complete yu certification.
